  "description": "FastWan 2.2 (FastVideo): Wan 2.2 TI2V 5B distilled to 3 denoising steps, to generate a video from a text much faster than undistilled models. Model limits: at most 5 seconds in one pass (121 frames at 24 fps — beyond that, the video is extended by chained segments, each starting again from the last frame: continuity is not guaranteed), a fixed 24 fps rate, native resolution 1280×704 (below it, quality drops). The number of steps, the guidance and therefore the negative prompt are imposed by the distillation (no effect here).",
